  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.31 \"Title brands\" means a consumer protection device in which various legends are recorded on the title to convey the status of a vehicle, for example, salvage or rebuilt vehicle.\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22 (from Saf-C 1901.28)\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.27)",
